{"id":"n56220-1-7","stage":1,"title":"미술관 · 美术馆","scene":"文化与休闲","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n56220-1-7-1","ko":"이번 주말에 미술관에 갈래요?","zh":"这周末要去美术馆吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주말에","meaning":"周末","explanation":"주말：周末；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주말","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19548","senseId":"1","lemma":"주말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"미술관에","meaning":"美术馆","explanation":"미술관：美术馆；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"미술관","audio":"/audio/03c34f236b077be22f36.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56220","senseId":"1","lemma":"미술관","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갈래요?","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；ㄹ래요：礼貌地表达意愿或询问对方意愿。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"dc80d0fe24783537","term":"주말","zh":"周末","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3","entryId":"19548","definition":"一周的尽头。","pronunciation":["주말"]},{"id":"03c34f236b077be2","term":"미술관","zh":"美术馆","audio":"/audio/03c34f236b077be22f36.mp3","entryId":"56220","definition":"为展示美术作品、供人欣赏而建造的设施。","pronunciation":["미ː술관"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a97fd180004ce3b40f53.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n56220-1-7-2","ko":"좋아요. 마침 제가 좋아하는 화가의 전시회가 열리던데요.","zh":"好啊。正好有我喜欢的画家的展览要举办呢。","no